X:1
T:Oj Jano Jano
O:Macedonia
N:Macedonian folk song, a lullaby, from the mu-tech.org WorldTrad setting. Moved down a fifth from G to C to sit on C4-G4. Melody MIDI diffed note by note; rhythm and the seven-beat phrase length come from that one source only. The setting plays the five phrases A A C A E, then repeats A C A E A A A; one pass of the first five is written. Its printed chords (including Cm) are a computer harmonization, so the chords here are derived from the melody instead.
M:7/4
Q:1/4=80
L:1/8
K:C
"C"E D E D2 C2 C3 C4 |"C"E D E D2 C2 C3 C4 |
"C"G G2 F2 E2 G2 F E "G"D "C"C2 |"C"E D E D2 C2 C3 C4 |
"C"C2 D E F F2 G2 F E "G"D "C"C2 |]
